{
  "candidateCarrier": {
    "default": "native"
  },
  "description": "新Flow默认fluid，沿实际容器排版；已有Flow保留其layout。普通标题、正文、图片和互动放正文block以自然占位，不用viewport绝对文字替代。insert使用create parent:flow-body，block只省略宿主生成的id。精确正文选区使用edit.textRange={slot,start,end}，slot支持field/content/citation/caption/title/body、item、header、cell，start/end按Unicode码点且公式占1；content.inlines只替换该范围，textStyle只设置该范围。整块修改标题、段落或引用块用edit的content.inlines/textStyle/textAlign/lineSpacing；公式用edit.formula的latex和accessibleText，保留formulaId；图片用edit.image.assetId，保留正文布局、说明和块身份。常规图片应用优先media.apply。未指定排版、富文本和元数据保留。replace/delete/move使用Flow block update target；replace必须保留id和类型。完整载体替换使用selection.replace。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "bindings": "values 的 block 来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"operation\":\"insert\",\"block\":values[\"block\"]}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"flow.content\",input,destination);",
      "operation": "insert"
    },
    {
      "bindings": "values 的 block 来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"operation\":\"replace\",\"block\":values[\"block\"]}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"flow.content\",input,destination);",
      "operation": "replace"
    },
    {
      "bindings": "values 的  来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"operation\":\"edit\"}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"flow.content\",input,destination);",
      "operation": "edit"
    },
    {
      "bindings": "values 的  来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"operation\":\"delete\"}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"flow.content\",input,destination);",
      "operation": "delete"
    },
    {
      "bindings": "values 的 parentId/index 来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"operation\":\"move\",\"parentId\":values[\"parentId\"],\"index\":values[\"index\"]}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"flow.content\",input,destination);",
      "operation": "move"
    },
    {
      "bindings": "values 的 change 来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"operation\":\"table-structure\",\"change\":values[\"change\"]}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"flow.content\",input,destination);",
      "operation": "table-structure"
    }
  ],
